---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quizzes | Valhouette Scribe"
  description="Self-diagnostic tools for digitally saturated adults. All quizzes run entirely in your browser. Nothing is transmitted, stored, or seen by anyone else."
>
  <section class="quiz-hub">
    <div class="hub-inner">
      <p class="hub-eyebrow">Quizzes</p>
      <h1 class="hub-title">Reflection Exercises</h1>
      <p class="hub-intro">
        Each reflection exercise explores a different aspect of modern life.
        They are designed to help you examine your own patterns of attention,
        identity, presence, and perception. The purpose is to help you see
        yourself more clearly.
      </p>

      <a href="/quizzes/calibration-index/" class="hub-card hub-card--featured">
        <span class="hub-card__badge">Recommended First</span>
        <h2 class="hub-card__title">The Calibration Index</h2>
        <p class="hub-card__desc">
          An exploration of attention, stimulation, and your current
          relationship with digital life. Designed as the starting point for
          understanding your patterns.
        </p>
        <span class="hub-card__meta"
          >13 questions · ~3 minutes · tiered result</span
        >
        <span class="hub-card__cta">Begin Reflection → </span>
      </a>

      <div class="hub-grid">
        <a href="/quizzes/attention-audit/" class="hub-card">
          <h2 class="hub-card__title">The Attention Audit</h2>
          <p class="hub-card__desc">
            Where does your focus actually live - on the task in front of you,
            or scattered across everything else running in the background.
          </p>
          <span class="hub-card__meta"
            >13 questions · ~3 minutes · tiered result</span
          >
          <span class="hub-card__cta">Begin Reflection →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/quizzes/borrowed-self-inventory/" class="hub-card">
          <h2 class="hub-card__title">The Borrowed Self Inventory</h2>
          <p class="hub-card__desc">
            How much of your taste, opinions, and ambitions are actually yours -
            and how much has been absorbed without you noticing.
          </p>
          <span class="hub-card__meta"
            >13 questions · ~3 minutes · raw score</span
          >
          <span class="hub-card__cta">Begin Reflection →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/quizzes/solitude-tolerance-test/" class="hub-card">
          <h2 class="hub-card__title">The Solitude Tolerance Test</h2>
          <p class="hub-card__desc">
            How long can you actually be alone - with no input, no task, no one
            watching - before it becomes unbearable.
          </p>
          <span class="hub-card__meta"
            >13 questions · ~3 minutes · tiered result</span
          >
          <span class="hub-card__cta">Begin Reflection →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .quiz-hub {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }
  .hub-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .hub-eyebrow {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9ca3af;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .hub-title {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    color: #fefce8;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .hub-intro {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    line-height: 1.85;
    max-width: 58ch;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
  }
  .hub-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background-color: #243b3b;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 2rem 2.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 254, 226, 0.08);
    transition:
      border-color 0.25s ease,
      transform 0.25s ease;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .hub-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 254, 226, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .hub-card--featured {
    padding: 2.5rem 2.25rem;
    border-color: rgba(255, 254, 226, 0.15);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hub-card__badge {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a2e2e;
    background: #b5a98e;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .hub-card__title {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
    color: #fefce8;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .hub-card__desc {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .hub-card__meta {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9ca3af;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .hub-card__cta {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #b5a98e;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .hub-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .hub-grid .hub-card {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
